?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Can you take me to the team fight area ?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^That’s all. Thanks!","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC ","/#","#","^portrait:smile","/#","^Hangin' around, just enjoying the evening cool.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC ","/#","#","^portrait:point","/#","^I don't know it's my first day out here!","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC","/#","^Sure thing, let’s go.","\n","ev","str","^TRPG_Exemple","/str",{"x()":"SwitchScene","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","end",{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC","/#","^See you around brotein shake!","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"npc_TRPG":[["#","^speaker:NPC","/#","^Hey, you defeat all those enemies yet?","\n","ev","str","^Nope.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^What are you doing?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Alright, gotta go.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC ","/#","#","^portrait:smile","/#","^Well...get to it!","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC ","/#","#","^portrait:smile","/#","^Hangin' around, just watching you battle.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","#","^speaker:NPC","/#","^See ya!","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Scene_Start":["ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestState"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^CAN_START","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.canStart"},{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^FINISHED","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.alreadyLeft"},{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"canStart":[["ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestId"},{"x()":"StartQuest","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","#","^speaker:Mayor","/#","^Your uncle Linus turned for the worse in the night. He is in Redwillow across the river.","\n","#","^speaker:Mayor","/#","^Luma can brew a Solara Bloom tonic for him, but only if you bring her the flower today. The bloom opens once, at noon, at the shrine. The gate there needs all four of you.","\n","#","^speaker:Mayor","/#","^After Luma brews it, your uncle needs to drink the tonic before sunset if you want its full strength.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Then we move now.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^We move in a second. If we start this day by rushing past each other, it will only get worse once we are tired.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^She is right. If everybody starts talking at once, I lose the plot and follow the wrong thing.","\n","#","^speaker:You","/#","^Then we name one rule for ourselves before we go. What's going to hold our group together when things start going wrong?","\n","ev","str","^Listen all the way through before answering.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Clarify what we're doing before we move.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Ask for help before somebody gets stranded alone.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^Call problems out without turning on each other.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^listen","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"primaryNorm","re":true},{"->":"norm_listen"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev","str","^clarify","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"primaryNorm","re":true},{"->":"norm_clarify"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev","str","^help","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"primaryNorm","re":true},{"->":"norm_help"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","ev","str","^respect","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"primaryNorm","re":true},{"->":"norm_respect"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"alreadyLeft":["#","^speaker:Mayor","/#","^Good luck out there. Linus is counting on you.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"norm_listen":["#","^speaker:You","/#","^Then that's the promise. Nobody gets cut off just because we are in a hurry.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Good. Then nobody gets skipped because someone louder is in a hurry.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Fine. Just do not let listening turn into stalling.","\n",{"->":"Start_Lead"},{"#f":1}],"norm_clarify":["#","^speaker:You","/#","^Then we slow down long enough to name the thing we're doing before we rush it.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Good. If I know what the job is, I can stay with it. My side ideas are rarely an improvement.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^That keeps us from solving the wrong problem.","\n",{"->":"Start_Lead"},{"#f":1}],"norm_help":["#","^speaker:You","/#","^Then we ask early, not after somebody is already in trouble.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Ask fast, then. Not after somebody freezes up.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^That seems kinder on everyone.","\n",{"->":"Start_Lead"},{"#f":1}],"norm_respect":["#","^speaker:You","/#","^Then we say what is wrong without making the person next to us the enemy.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Good. Hit the problem. Not the person.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^That keeps the conversation useful.","\n",{"->":"Start_Lead"},{"#f":1}],"Start_Lead":[["^The east road to the shrine is open. Nobody expects another calm pause once you take it.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Do we want one team leader? I can do it, but all of you will have to listen when things start going wrong.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Or we can just work it out together as we go along.","\n","ev","str","^Keep leadership shared.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Let Joyce take point.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^shared","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"leadStyle","re":true},{"->":"lead_shared"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev","str","^joyce","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"leadStyle","re":true},{"->":"lead_joyce"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"lead_shared":["#","^speaker:You","/#","^We keep it shared unless we start tripping over each other. Aisha speaks up if she sees a risk. Joyce makes the call if we stall. Ralph, if you get lost, say it.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Fine. If I call it, nobody waits.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Good. Then everybody knows what each person needs to do.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^I can do that. Specific is good for me.","\n",{"->":"Start_Depart"},{"#f":1}],"lead_joyce":["#","^speaker:You","/#","^You take point when the pressure spikes. Aisha speaks up if she sees a risk. Ralph, if you get lost, say it.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Good. That keeps us moving.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Then I speak the second I see the wrong turn.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^That actually helps. Unsupervised Ralph has a poor record.","\n",{"->":"Start_Depart"},{"#f":1}],"Start_Depart":["ev",{"VAR?":"leadStyle"},"str","^joyce","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Joyce takes the front without another word. Aisha watches the edges. Ralph stays close enough to hear every call.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Joyce still leans forward, but the group stays together around her. Aisha watches the edges. Ralph stays close enough to speak if he gets lost.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","#","^speaker:Mayor","/#","^Good luck! Linus is counting on you.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestId"},{"x()":"FinishQuest","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_dialogue":["ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestState"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.guard_push"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_START","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.guard_push"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^IN_PROGRESS","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.guard_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_FINISH","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.guard_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^FINISHED","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.guard_after"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"guard_push":[["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Hey. You. The mayor's been waiting on you since dawn.","\n","ev","str","^We were just getting ready.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What does he want?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^We'll get there when we get there.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_push_b"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_what"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_pushback"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"guard_push_b":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Getting ready takes a minute. Leaving your uncle to die takes a day.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Go talk to the mayor.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_what":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Not my place to say. His place to say.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Which is why you should be over there talking to him instead of over here talking to me.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_pushback":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Your call. But the bloom only opens at noon and the mayor knows where the shrine is.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Just saying.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_during":[["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Good. You're moving. That's what I like to see.","\n","ev","str","^Any advice for the road?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Keep the square safe while we're gone.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_advice"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_safe"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"guard_advice":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Stay together. The road past the cart gets narrow and people make bad decisions when they're in a hurry.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^You look like people who might be in a hurry.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_safe":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^That's what they pay me for.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Now go. Clock's running.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_after":[["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^You made it back. Good.","\n","ev","str","^Did you doubt us?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Quiet day here?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_doubt"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.guard_quiet"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"guard_doubt":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Little bit, yeah. No offense.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^You had that look people get right before things go sideways.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Glad I was wrong. Now get moving — the road to Redwillow isn't going to walk itself.","\n","ev","str","^TRPG_Exemple","/str",{"x()":"SwitchScene","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"guard_quiet":["#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Blessedly. Exactly how I like it.","\n","#","^speaker:Guard","/#","^Get some rest. You look like you earned it. Go on, head out.","\n","ev","str","^TRPG_Exemple","/str",{"x()":"SwitchScene","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"joyce_dialogue":["ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestState"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.joyce_before"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_START","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.joyce_before"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^IN_PROGRESS","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.joyce_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_FINISH","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.joyce_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^FINISHED","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.joyce_after"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"joyce_before":[["#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^We're just standing here. I don't love standing here.","\n","ev","str","^We're waiting for the right moment.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Are you ready to go?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.joyce_before_b"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.joyce_ready"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"joyce_before_b":["#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^The right moment is the one where we stop talking and start moving.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Talk to the mayor when you're done warming up.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"joyce_ready":["#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Have been since before you woke up.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Talk to the mayor. The sooner we know what we're dealing with, the sooner we move.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"joyce_during":[["#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^We've got a job. Let's not forget that while we're chatting.","\n","ev","str","^Right. Focus.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Any concerns before we go?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Good. Keep that energy.","\n","end",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.joyce_concern"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"joyce_concern":["#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^One. We move as a unit or we don't move at all.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^I've seen groups fall apart at the first obstacle because everyone went their own direction.","\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Not us. Not today.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"joyce_after":[["#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^We did what we came to do. Linus has a chance.","\n","ev","str","^Couldn't have done it without you.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What's next for you?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^You could have. It would have just been uglier.","\n","end",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^speaker:Joyce","/#","^Same as always. Find the next thing that needs doing and do it.","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"aisha_dialogue":["ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestState"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.aisha_before"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_START","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.aisha_before"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^IN_PROGRESS","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.aisha_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_FINISH","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.aisha_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^FINISHED","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.aisha_after"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"aisha_before":[["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^I've been watching the square. Everyone's a little tense this morning.","\n","ev","str","^Including you?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Any idea what the mayor wants?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.aisha_tense"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.aisha_mayor"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"aisha_tense":["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^A little. But tense and ready aren't the same thing.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^I'd rather feel the weight of something before I carry it.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"aisha_mayor":["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^The letter mentioned Linus. Beyond that I didn't want to guess.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Guessing before you have the facts tends to send you in the wrong direction.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"aisha_during":[["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^We're in the middle of something. What do you need?","\n","ev","str","^Just checking in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Any worries about the road ahead?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.aisha_checkin"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.aisha_worry"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"aisha_checkin":["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Checking in is good. Most people wait until something's already wrong.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^We're holding together. Keep it that way.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"aisha_worry":["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^A few. But worry without a plan is just noise.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^I'm watching. If I see something, I'll say it.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"aisha_after":[["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^It's strange how much can happen in a single day.","\n","ev","str","^Are you alright?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^We made the right calls.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.aisha_alright"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.aisha_calls"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"aisha_alright":["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^I think so. Tired. A little glad it's over.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Ask me again tomorrow. I'll have had time to think about it properly.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"aisha_calls":["#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^Most of them. The ones we got wrong taught us something too.","\n","#","^speaker:Aisha","/#","^That's usually how it goes.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"ralph_dialogue":["ev",{"VAR?":"SpiretonMainQuestState"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.ralph_before"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_START","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.ralph_before"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^IN_PROGRESS","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.ralph_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^CAN_FINISH","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.ralph_during"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^FINISHED","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.ralph_after"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["pop","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"ralph_before":[["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Oh good. Someone to talk to. I've been standing here trying to look purposeful.","\n","ev","str","^Is it working?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Are you nervous?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.ralph_purposeful"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.ralph_nervous"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ralph_purposeful":["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Probably not. Joyce keeps glancing over like she's already disappointed in me.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Which, to be fair, is a reasonable baseline.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ralph_nervous":["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^A bit, yeah. I do better when I know what the job is.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Right now the job is just standing here, and somehow I'm still managing to do it wrong.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ralph_during":[["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Still here. Still helpful. Mostly.","\n","ev","str","^Staying focused?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Any questions about the plan?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.ralph_focused"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.ralph_plan"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ralph_focused":["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Trying. My brain keeps offering me alternative ideas that nobody asked for.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^I've been saying no to them. It's going okay.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ralph_plan":["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^A few, but they're the kind I can figure out by just watching what everyone else does.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^I find that works better than asking and then immediately forgetting the answer.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ralph_after":[["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^We made it. All of us. Including me, which I'll admit was not guaranteed.","\n","ev","str","^You came through when it counted.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What did you learn today?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.ralph_came_through"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.ralph_learned"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ralph_came_through":["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Eventually. After a detour involving a rabbit.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^I'm choosing to remember the coming through part more than the rabbit part.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ralph_learned":["#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^Ask before you wander off. Stay where someone can see you.","\n","#","^speaker:Ralph","/#","^And rabbits are not, in fact, ever leading anywhere useful.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev","str","^CollectCoinsQuest","/str",{"VAR=":"CollectCoinsQuestId"},"str","^SpiretonMainQuest","/str",{"VAR=":"SpiretonMainQuestId"},"str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str",{"VAR=":"CollectCoinsQuestState"},"str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str",{"VAR=":"SpiretonMainQuestState"},"str","^REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET","/str",{"VAR=":"npcSmallTalk_State"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"primaryNorm"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"leadStyle"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}